  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Nodnod 03: 感情不是一场竞赛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/612f333cba54cbee52e3d19a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">612f333cba54cbee52e3d19a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Sep 2021 08:01:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你可以在这些地方找到我👉 公众号/微博： @袁岱川&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>前两天我和男朋友@flypig 逃离城市，去在阿那亚度过了一个非常美妙的周末，周六晚上我们一起录制了本期的播客，回答了听众朋友们的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>鉴于本期播客的时长达到了前所未有的40分钟，我为大家整理出了一份摘要，将播客分为两个部分：第一部分是一些网友提到的关于影像方面和对@flypig 本人的一些问题，第二部分是我们两一起回答的有关情感和情侣相处的问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part I</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">1:45</a>&nbsp;- 想问飞猪还做直播吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">2:23</a>&nbsp;- NOMO以后的规划/FP还会上新吗/最爱的实体胶片机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">4:00</a>- 飞猪老师对想考电影专业的学生有什么建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">6:55</a> - 新手剪视频如何更好的使用 log 模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2222">37:02</a>&nbsp;- 飞猪老师获取知识和信息的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part II</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">5:25</a> - 飞猪和川川是哪里毕业的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">8:30</a> - 各说一个最喜欢的服装/护肤和数码品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> - 对各自服装品牌的规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> - 飞猪和川川怎么认识的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="875">14:35</a> - 两个人相处有磨合的过程吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> - 情侣送礼物价值不对等怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">18:26</a> - 如何看待现在越来越多的情侣节日/七夕/纪念日等等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1191">19:51</a> - 对方哪一点最吸引你？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">22:54</a> - 川川在恋爱中最想获得的是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1459">24:19</a> - 飞猪和川川差几岁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1492">24:52</a> - 如何去确定对方是对的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">24:39</a> - 两个人的相处模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">26:28</a> - 如何维护异国恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1648">27:28</a> - 在平时生活中怎么增加趣味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> - 两个人如何做到保持同频的进步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> - 异国恋发生过的有意思的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2004">33:24</a> - 两个人对彼此的初印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">35:53</a>- 各自最看重的品质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a>- 彼此在这段关系中觉得很幸福的时刻</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmed1-b1IZVH3HfC0STWZxs9pOob.m4a" length="38839175" type="audio/mp4"/>
